# Keeps the build context small and stops host artefacts leaking into the
# image — a copied node_modules would carry the host's platform binaries, which
# is how "works on my machine" becomes "works in my container only".

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets never enter the build context. The compose stack injects them.
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

**/*.log
.DS_Store

# Large docs the image has no use for.
PRD.md
screens.md
